Package: sensor-w1therm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, sensor-control (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests: bash-completion
Description: w1_therm temperature sensor reader for WildlifeSystems
 A utility to read temperature data from w1_therm 1-Wire temperature
 sensors connected via the Linux kernel w1_therm driver interface.
 Outputs readings in JSON format compatible with the WildlifeSystems
 sensor-control framework.
 .
 Includes a systemd service to configure sensors for fast reading
 after boot.
